   "t": "Посмотри фильм Свадьба по скайпу.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Watch the movie Wedding on Skype.' Slavik suggests a contemporary comedy about modern romance.",
   "gap": 0.4
